Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Zero-initialize 10-bit buffers in VideoFrameBufferPool

Add InitializeData() to I010Buffer and I210Buffer, and invoke
InitializeData() in VideoFrameBufferPool when zero_initialize_ is
enabled for I010, I210, and I410 buffers.

Fixed: chromium:504552032
Change-Id: I36ce748c3da44e4f119332de5c180f80eca93cc9
Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/509582
Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov <danilchap@webrtc.org>
Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson <tommi@webrtc.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48948}
(cherry picked from commit f30a911f678645a72c09bb319922f73ee0035411)
